  "source_sha256": "7d7a2e32db0cc4834776f575890dbecb2cccf20ae6c689030823b7b43d7a0279",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b1a524a2e464e1b9f6f548a961fbe3d74b00948dcfa430e3bc2dc4b71c4e5831",
      "text": "Princess Iron Fan’s\nRibbon Parade",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a090d4f6ba18924628bd3ad7760a09ec94105d10498e120b0ba856289bfaa23c",
      "text": "Iron Fan has a plan.\n“Let’s have a ribbon parade!”\n“One ribbon for each of us.”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8370cc4aa32b088f1ed085c2bd7057826885675c5ae5934474b3689ce70a044f",
      "text": "Rabbit gets the yellow one.\nIron Fan gets the purple one.\nWukong gets the red one.\nIt is all rolled up.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "33380883098ffb8db24cde1acb81078ac67d26bc2dbe0f6143c2f3ae0ae6d874",
      "text": "Wukong frowns.\n“Mine is the shortest!”\n“Let’s look again,” says\nIron Fan.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "575eb26a17bc417508f6a7db1ad47b8dea4e6bf9ac6f879f215a4e2eedd16f71",
      "text": "Wukong pulls and pulls.\nWhoa!\nThe red ribbon goes on and on.\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "789523b0baa7d3f3789c147cb996bc95f6a5d5c540722328aa2f32bf915ea440",
      "text": "They lay the ribbons down.\nHe slides his red one ahead.\n“Now mine is the longest!”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "66c336925dd17c6982eb05337f2b12ac6497e9e5efee0d33481eb1fdfaeb3b9c",
      "text": "Rabbit giggles.\n“Your ribbon starts way\nup there!”\n“That’s a sneaky start.”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e6e701f9129002ca06aaf615d780a2be71f3081df9162ea4e1f635669ea23f8",
      "text": "Iron Fan taps the stone edge.\n“Start at the same line.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b79f713f603df5a3b7db45b19a02731c14da70ece6073d98a34146ea9d306502",
      "text": "Yellow and purple start at\nthe line.\n“The purple ribbon is longer.”\n“The yellow ribbon is shorter.”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3eb15fe748d7f0bf4f40ce9533179b42e01176de8fe483df79a541a3a3146749",
      "text": "Now red starts at the\nline, too.\n“Red is longer than purple!”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7a5b06806cae2ecf7d4d02941e188e77d0eff1c4f6119e8449e254b57fc52baf",
      "text": "Rabbit points at each one.\n“Short. Longer. Longest!”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c031a968a67373493f8c8e6a6114ac523bf5e924117843c910ec363174d8050",
      "text": "Wukong cheers.\n“Mine is the longest.\nFor real this time!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "99a420fd5fda045f54bf3967a52fdd03bfbfd90bac325ddcad1a7612bab7e882",
      "text": "The parade begins!\nRabbit twirls her short ribbon.\nIron Fan waves her\nribbon high.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce82555b54d310591462cc8e49a2fde75233f49192f965fe68cff3dd7857d168",
      "text": "Wukong runs.\nHis long ribbon flies\nbehind him.\n“Look! I have two tails!”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "670b9ddc0ef2466ea90284c9f3605024df1fa8a175389233ca661fac87c07b58",
      "text": "Oops! The ribbon wraps\naround him.\nIron Fan opens her fan.\nA tiny breeze. Whoosh!\nThe ribbon floats free.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a44a418c93f009c46c72123586e6d3cb9197b357c979e484da12512aa5be87ec",
      "text": "The parade is over.\nThey line up the\nribbons again.\nShort, longer, longest.\n“What a parade!”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
